{
  "name": "autonomous.review_patch",
  "description": "生成された Patch を AI がレビューし品質スコアを付ける",
  "factory_id": "autonomous",
  "steps": [
    {
      "step_id": "review",
      "name": "Patch レビュー",
      "step_type": "ai_task",
      "config": {
        "agent_id": "patch_reviewer",
        "output_key": "review_result",
        "task_type": "analysis",
        "prompt": "## タスク\n{task_title}\n\n## Patch\n```diff\n{patch_text}\n```\n\n品質・安全性・目的適合性を評価し、以下の JSON 形式で回答してください:\n{\"score\":8.5,\"summary\":\"...\",\"risks\":[\"...\"],\"suggestions\":[\"...\"]}\n\nJSON のみ出力。"
      },
      "on_failure": "abort"
    },
    {
      "step_id": "save",
      "name": "レビュー結果保存",
      "step_type": "file_save",
      "config": {
        "content_from_context": "review_result",
        "output_dir": "output/autonomous",
        "filename_prefix": "review",
        "extension": "json"
      },
      "on_failure": "continue"
    }
  ]
}
